OL,3,GNEWSCBBC Northern Ireland to get new
OL,4,Cstudio at Belfast Stories
OL,5,
OL,6,FBelfast City Council has agreed to
OL,7,Fproceed with building a studio at the
OL,8,FBelfast Stories development, for use by
OL,9,FBBC Northern Ireland.
OL,11,FThe news was confirmed in an internal
OL,12,Fcommunication to BBC Northern Ireland
OL,13,Fstaff yesterday.
OL,23,EPub: 06-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,143,140,200,120,0,100
