OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G7/7
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCBBC Northern Ireland to get new
OL,4,Cstudio at Belfast Stories
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe ambition is for one building doing
OL,7,Fthree jobs simultaneously ` somewhere
OL,8,Fto gather, something to visit, and a
OL,9,Fbase for creative work ` telling
OL,10,FBelfast's history, present and future
OL,11,Fthrough text, imagery and audio, with a
OL,12,Fsizeable event hall at its heart.
OL,14,FMore than 700,000 admissions annually
OL,15,Fis the figure the council is working
OL,16,Ftowards, alongside reviving the
OL,17,Fsurrounding streets and building up the
OL,18,Fcreative economy.
OL,23,EPub: 06-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
